<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.bag.declares ~ a bag names its tier, its home, its repo and its role

`declare <bag>` writes (or amends) the bag's own declaration: `tier=` (its cap-tier), `home=` (one of the homes a bag may name), `repo=` (a REGISTERED repo id, never a directory; an unregistered id refuses), `role=` (one line). It wants at least one of the four. Declaring moves NO bytes: relocation takes `lares bag home`, and a declaration that now disagrees with where the bytes sit marks the bag ADRIFT. A standing daemon re-stamps the catalog row at once (`restamp-bag-tier`), so a tier change takes the row's stamp; with no daemon the next boot stamps it.

The reserved TW5 docs name refuses (`bag declare`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ tighten-the-tier · name-a-home

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`tighten-the-tier` params=`bag/lares tier/private ~ declare the bag's cap-tier`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`name-a-home` params=`bag/lares home/repository repo/lares-repo ~ declare the bag's home as a registered repo`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ bag · tier · home · repo · role

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bag` params=`takes/slug needs/required seat/1 as/<bag> ~ the bag to declare`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tier` params=`takes/cap-tier ~ the bag's cap-tier; it only ever tightens against the structural floor`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`home` params=`takes/home ~ where the bag belongs`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`repo` params=`takes/repo-id ~ a registered repo's id; the declaration carries the id and never a path`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`role` params=`takes/words ~ one line naming what the bag holds`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a local write of the bag's own declaration beside its bytes; moves nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ declare-nothing · home-unknown · repo-unregistered

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`declare-nothing` params=`cure/[[carriage.bag.declares bag/<bag> tier/private]] ~ declare wants something to declare: tier=, home=, repo= or role=`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`home-unknown` params=`~ home= expects one of the homes a bag may name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`repo-unregistered` params=`cure/[[carriage.bag.registers]] ~ the repo id stands registered on no vessel here; register it first`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

